# Celebi
amie-motion-251-drowse = { $pokemon } bows its head forward as its arms droop. Then it jolts up with its arms flung out, and rubs its eye with one hand.
amie-motion-251-eat = { $pokemon } pulls its arms in to its sides and chews. Then it spreads its arms out again.
amie-motion-251-happyA = { $pokemon } ducks its head forward. Then it springs up with a big smile and its arms spread wide, and settles back.
amie-motion-251-happyB = { $pokemon } twirls around and flies up into the air with one arm raised high. Then it drifts down with its arms spread.
amie-motion-251-happyC = { $pokemon } zooms off out of sight in a big loop. Then it drops back into place with its arms spread wide.
amie-motion-251-hate = { $pokemon } bows its head and twists its body away from you. Then it turns back to face forward with its mouth open.
amie-motion-251-lonely = { $pokemon } droops its head and turns away to one side. It glances back, then turns away once more. Then it faces forward again.
amie-motion-251-mad = { $pokemon } ducks its head and frowns. Then it lowers its head further and spreads its arms out wide and low.
amie-motion-251-moveA = { $pokemon } leans far down to one side and peers. Then it hovers up into the air and drifts back into place.
amie-motion-251-moveC = { $pokemon } bows its head and stretches its arms straight out to each side. Then it lifts its head and bows it once more.
amie-motion-251-playA = { $pokemon } bounces up with a smile and its arms spread wide, and kicks one leg out. Then it lands and bows its head.
amie-motion-251-sleep = { $pokemon } sinks down out of sight. Later the top of its head rises back into view, and it peeks out before dipping low again.
amie-motion-251-touch = { $pokemon } swings one arm out to the side. Then it floats up smiling with its hands raised to its chest, and drifts down.
